/* Critical rows. Rows keep their source order. hl rows at the top (is-lead) span both columns, the parameter at h3 and
   the value one step larger. Only the first highlighted row is tinted (flow-tint, the brand's one highlight); any
   later highlight is marked with a 2 px flow line on its left instead. */
